    "detail": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">维生素龙头，享受稳定增长</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1，维生素VA,VE行业，门槛高，为寡头垄断格局。</span></p>\n<p>全球共有6家VA生产企业，全球合计产能为39000吨。其中新和成为全球VA生产龙头，具有VA年产能8000吨。</p>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\">全球共有7家具有VE生产能力的企业，总产能为15万吨，新和成、帝斯曼与能特科技的产能均为3万吨。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/0602_20220906144248_bba1eb812a113c2e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"458\" height=\"352\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/0601_20220906144300_088a680e1ee480e1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"461\" height=\"338\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2，维生素VA,VE下游需求稳定增长，价格波动由供给端主导。</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\">由于行业为寡头垄断，难有新进玩家，供给端波动会直接影响维生素价格。</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/0603_20220906144619_bab8f34c1d047a9c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"840\" height=\"360\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\"><img src=\"https://cdn.upchinaproduct.com/theme/driveLogicImgs/0604_20220906144818_0a316def3404e825.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"865\" height=\"339\" /></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3，欧洲能源危机影响，巴斯夫欧洲工厂面临停产风险。</span></div>\n<div data-canvas-width=\"105.01919999999998\">2022年，欧洲天然气价格持续大涨，巴斯夫（德国），大量使用天然气，60%自己发电，40%作为原料。这类公司对天然气高度依赖。<br />一旦缺气，就会有停产的危险。这里不仅是危险了，现在巨头已经对旗下工厂发出了停工警告，部分工厂已经停工。</div>",
